{"id":1143,"date":"2021-02-11T00:57:21","date_gmt":"2021-02-11T00:57:21","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/?post_type=rdrcnews&#038;p=1143"},"modified":"2021-02-11T05:59:28","modified_gmt":"2021-02-11T05:59:28","slug":"queens-small-business-grant-program","status":"publish","type":"rdrcnews","link":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/rdrcnews\/queens-small-business-grant-program\/","title":{"rendered":"Queens Small Business Grant Program"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">RDRC\/GJDC Small Business Info Session. Thursday, Feb., 11th 3pm. Register<span style=\"color: #b87614;\"> <a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/zoom.us\/meeting\/register\/tJYvdeyqrj4sGd10reCXbmmeGDFRW8yLZ0Zj\">here<\/a><\/span>.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/zoom.us\/meeting\/register\/tJYvdeyqrj4sGd10reCXbmmeGDFRW8yLZ0Zj\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-1148\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Capture-RDRC-GJDC-Grant-Processing-Thur.-Feb.-11th-3pm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"285\" height=\"412\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Capture-RDRC-GJDC-Grant-Processing-Thur.-Feb.-11th-3pm.png 505w, https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Capture-RDRC-GJDC-Grant-Processing-Thur.-Feb.-11th-3pm-208x300.png 208w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 285px) 100vw, 285px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">IT&#8217;S NOT TOO LATE! Join, The Queens CBO&#8217;s, RDRC and GJDC to get all the new grant opportunities for small businesses in the Rockaways and Queens community. <\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">We are pleased to announce, the Queens Borough President Donovan Richards, in partnership with the City and\u00a0<span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a class=\"editor-rtfLink\" style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"http:\/\/r20.rs6.net\/tn.jsp?f=00171SIMSXx0FOHDMMpL4hrtwI7DhPhqi5RpZWaGCO_Dixe3TLiRlQYzSym2z9jXb2zLB3nHTalfEQp3GtKr4ogC-4apPvMxjJ7lG2HCwpnj0j6BF6bqeBCAuEEeLyY38C5mBCUy6oGDK2RbCYKEnjD5g==&amp;c=Hi4KDrvareILk0mStz-XScuM4NMvVv1RX-GfJE08p5ZiLLveb_2gLA==&amp;ch=gq0dHJ_a6EApkiuCmt7x-VzqZc9STQD7tckze-LZqM3Kq8Gz3nUFNw==\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Pursuit<\/a><\/span>; launch of the Queens Small Business Grant Program to provide resources to small businesses impacted by COVID-19. Through a generous $17.5 million donation from\u00a0<span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a class=\"editor-rtfLink\" style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"http:\/\/r20.rs6.net\/tn.jsp?f=00171SIMSXx0FOHDMMpL4hrtwI7DhPhqi5RpZWaGCO_Dixe3TLiRlQYzSym2z9jXb2zECaznqQuOwWlug4wqX325j9XZXpF0VikqEABvaD3tckhSFcwDlO6sbmbcqCo1hCG6TBRAMbyGHRmriF0ivNdg65LQ_8N4i-PKGhga4wLqmXsCLTwkgFR9-WqqnEY7iDMvUDCkRFowwX4B3HhmraPJ9RO3uq6YGITQOr8rcNieb_Nz0OaOTOIbA6_u3jXcbZfQcrkJFrEF_D83j5Z5rmxWKMIu11p3VD_&amp;c=Hi4KDrvareILk0mStz-XScuM4NMvVv1RX-GfJE08p5ZiLLveb_2gLA==&amp;ch=gq0dHJ_a6EApkiuCmt7x-VzqZc9STQD7tckze-LZqM3Kq8Gz3nUFNw==\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Steve Cohen<\/a><\/span>, the City will partner with community-based organizations to offer $15 million worth of grants to Queens small businesses in need up to $20,000 to support operational expenses.\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Our partnership with the <span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/gjdc.org\/\">Greater Jamaica Development Corporation (GJDC)<\/a><\/span> provides technical assistance to help small businesses applying for the new Queens Small Business Grant Program. For complete details, please visit\u00a0<span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"http:\/\/r20.rs6.net\/tn.jsp?f=00171SIMSXx0FOHDMMpL4hrtwI7DhPhqi5RpZWaGCO_Dixe3TLiRlQYzVtUM2QQ1PqDZmAWxXSbgpiSbvkJQZynx2R5PFAwQ8lR0Ub9Eqagvg-4aohLDgdTn4KfFME8yY7ZwOkGsZkor_IKivmoIh4RWQ4c2Y3TDh35Po364kVTvmw2Z0GUKDGSNyMMOhmRGXJG&amp;c=Hi4KDrvareILk0mStz-XScuM4NMvVv1RX-GfJE08p5ZiLLveb_2gLA==&amp;ch=gq0dHJ_a6EApkiuCmt7x-VzqZc9STQD7tckze-LZqM3K